      <size maxheight='1500' maxwidth='1000' minheight='1500' minwidth='1000' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='4399' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='533'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#be0000' fontsize='18'>Reference</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='2534' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='4932'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#be0000' fontsize='14'>Metrics</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='18533' id='6' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='7466'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontsize='12'>- </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#be0000' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Coverage</run>
              <run fontcolor='#be0000' fontsize='12'>:</run>
              <run fontsize='12'> the average amount of code covered by tests</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>- </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#be0000' fontsize='12' underline='true'>NCLOC:</run>
              <run fontsize='12'> or Non-Commented lines of code is basically the size of the project; is the amount of lines that actually gets compiled/interpreted and goes to production.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>- </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#be0000' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Cyclomatic Complexity</run>
              <run fontcolor='#be0000' fontsize='12' underline='true'>:</run>
              <run fontsize='12'> it&apos;s a metric to measure the complexity of a program and is given by the number of lines with linearly independent paths.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>- </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#be0000' fontsize='12' underline='true'>Cognitive Complexity:</run>
              <run fontsize='12'> it&apos;s one of the newest ways to measure complexity of a program, and it&apos;s not so strongly based on algorithms to calculate the complexity, but wether which statements are way much more difficult to read and understand. We can see an example below:</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3333' id='8' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='81799'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#be0000' fontsize='14'>Side Notes / Disclaimers</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='14335' id='9' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='85132'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontsize='12'>At this moment, all iOS components (component_type = ios-module) are not reporting neither cyclomatic nor cognitive complexity. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>Also, on Swift/Objective-C code bases there&apos;s only a tool that supports a </run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12'>simil-cognitive complexity metric</run>
              <run fontsize='12'> that&apos;s named Lizard (</run>
              <run auto-url='true' fontsize='12' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://github.com/terryyin/lizard/&amp;quot;'>https://github.com/terryyin/lizard/</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>). It&apos;s important to understand this as </run>
              <run bold='true' fontsize='12' italic='true'>we&apos;ll see big cognitive complexity numbers on ios-modules </run>
              <run fontsize='12'>as soon as we implement this tool in our pipelines. Those numbers are big because this simil-cognitive complexity is based on the calculus of cyclomatic complexity with some exceptions.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='4333' id='10' type-v2='empty' w='98400' x='800' y='77466'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3133' id='11' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='57399'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#be0000' fontsize='14'>Next Steps</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='16934' id='12' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='60532'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontsize='12'>- Add </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#be0000' fontsize='12'>contributions (build, deploys)</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>. This would allow us to understand many behaviours and answer questions like:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>    - Are we releasing frequently?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>    - Are we contributing to a non-operational project?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>    - Which project seems to be the most important (most contributed)? How&apos;s the health of it?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>- Add </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#be0000' fontsize='12'>incidents (bugs, monitors, crashes)</run>
              <run fontsize='12'>. This would enable us to fully understand the impact of health metrics with what we consider incidents.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='31400' id='13' is-scaled='1' param='Image/CognitiveComplexity.jpg' type-v2='bitmap' w='98400' x='800' y='25999'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
